1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,560
Let's play chase !

25
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,360
Wan'er,

26
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,680
I will wait for you to be reborn.

27
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:57,080
6 months later

28
00:02:58,440 --> 00:02:59,200
Push !

29
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,240
Come on !

30
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,560
I see it.

31
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:02,960
Harder !

32
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,080
Awesome !

33
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,160
Congratulations, Mister Zhou.

34
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,480
It's a girl.

35
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,120
Mother and daughter are safe.

36
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,360
But the kid's body

37
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,000
is very weak.

38
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,400
You'll have to take care of her.

39
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,520
Definitely. Definitely.

40
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,760
Thank you.

41
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,600
Come on in.

42
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:43,240
Zhou Ru

43
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:47,160
It worked.

44
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:56,000
Given how weak Wan'er's Nascent Soul is,

45
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,880
it will take about 18 years for her to wake up

46
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:00,420
and recover her memory.

47
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,360
At that time,

48
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:05,400
the law of the heavens will surely come again...

49
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,360
Wan'er,

50
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,960
I will protect you.

51
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:14,640
1 year later

52
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,280
Senior,

53
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,640
Going through Chu is the easiest way to reach the Immortal Graveyard.

54
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,120
Then it's up to Senior.

55
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,880
I haven't come to Chu in 100 years.

56
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:31,120
There seems to be many changes.

57
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,120
Yes it has,

58
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,160
I heard that nowadays the Cloud Sky Sect

59
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,720
is the number one sect in Chu.

60
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:39,040
It's not what it used to be.

61
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,880
A messenger from Suzaku ?

62
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:58,120
What is he doing here ?

63
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:00,110
Fellow cultivator Ceng Niu,

64
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,520
Mount Suzaku ordered

65
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,120
that in 3 months,

66
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,490
in the western Heaven Temple,

67
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,470
you are to fight Red Butterfly.

68
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,160
What ?

69
00:05:08,550 --> 00:05:09,320
Ceng Niu ?

70
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,640
Go back and tell them

71
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,200
that if they want a fight

72
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:19,080
it will have to be in 10 years.

73
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:24,520
This Ceng Niu is really something.

74
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,640
He doesn't even give in to the country of Suzaku.

75
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,560
Old friends in the valley,

76
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,680
please come in.

77
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,410
Old friends ?

78
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:48,280
Wang Lin ?!

79
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:48,280
It's him !

80
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,200
Fellow cultivators,

81
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,560
please sit.

82
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:59,760
I don't know if I should call you fellow cultivator Wang

83
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:01,520
or fellow cultivator Ceng.

84
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,710
Names are just what we call each other.

85
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,300
There is no need to worry too much about it.

86
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,160
Back then,

87
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:08,160
I didn't know Senior's identity.

88
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,860
I hope Senior can forgive my rudeness.

89
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,120
If I understand correctly

90
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,880
you're going to the Immortal Graveyard

91
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,520
to find your father's body.

92
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:18,920
Exactly.

93
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,360
Brother Wang,

94
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:24,160
why don't you come with us ?

95
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:29,680
Why did you agree to go, fellow cultivator Sun ?

96
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,440
Senior,

97
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,960
inside the Immortal Graveyard there's a relic

98
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:37,240
named the Reincarnation Tree.

99
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,550
Junior has a map that can lead us there.

100
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,040
If you meditate under it,

101
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:44,880
you can experience a life cycle, it's useful for Soul Formation domains.

102
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,920
This may be helpful for Nascent Soul cultivators

103
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:51,560
but for those above the middle stage of Soul Formation

104
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,270
the effects are minimal.

105
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:57,200
I believe fellow cultivator Sun has other goals for this trip.

106
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,160
Brother Wang is very insightful,

107
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,400
I'm impressed.

108
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:06,040
Fellow cultivator Zi Xin, don't blame me.

109
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:08,120
If it was just for the Reincarnation Tree,

110
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,040
I wouldn't follow you there.

111
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,760
What I want

112
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:13,840
is the Reincarnation Fruit.

113
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,320
the Reincarnation Fruit ?

114
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,400
That's right !

115
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,360
The Reincarnation Fruit

116
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:22,160
will increase one's chance of reaching Soul Transformation by 30%.

117
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:24,960
It's a treasure for us Soul Formation cultivators.

118
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:27,360
If Brother Wang is willing to go

119
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:29,160
harvest Reincarnation Fruits,

120
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,760
we will split them evenly.

121
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,640
How does it sound ?

122
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,630
If they're so precious,

123
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,540
why don't you just keep them for yourself

124
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,960
instead of asking me for help ?

125
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,880
Brother Wang doesn't know

126
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,200
but the Immortal Graveyard

127
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:45,360
is a very dangerous place.

128
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:47,720
Entrance of the
Immortal Graveyard

129
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:48,640
It's the home of powerful native savages.

130
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:51,040
Even the country of Suzaku dreads them.

131
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,440
If Brother Wang accompanies me,

132
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:56,080
this trip will be much safer.

133
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,620
As long as we find the Reincarnation Tree,

134
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:02,360
I have a method for it to bear fruit

135
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,520
within 3 hours.

136
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:06,160
Interested now ?

137
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,000
How about this:

138
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:16,520
we will wait for you outside the Immortal Graveyard for a month.

139
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,800
If you don’t come,

140
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:19,320
it's alright.

141
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,560
We will go on our own.

142
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:22,720
See you.

143
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:30,840
Tu Si's memory mentioned the Reincarnation Fruit.

144
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:34,080
If smeared over an Ancient God's body

145
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,680
it will cleanse the meridians

146
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,600
and merge with the flesh and blood.

147
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:41,640
The speed at which the body absorbs energy

148
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,480
will increase significantly.

149
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:45,720
This process

150
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,240
is called body cleansing.

151
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,880
Only through body cleansing

152
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,880
can one be regarded as a true Ancient God.

153
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:57,160
Red Butterfly's residence
Country of Suzaku

154
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:05,770
The Elders were furious because Ceng Niu postponed the battle.

155
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:08,170
I wanted to go down there to catch him myself

156
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,360
but these guys stopped me again.

157
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:13,400
I don't even know who this Ceng Niu is.

158
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,960
I can't believe they intervened 3 times already.

159
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,020
Junior Sister,

160
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:23,500
why don't I sneak down the mountain and kill him for you ?

161
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,640
Even if they find out

162
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,960
they will only punish me to 100 years of secluded cultivation.

163
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,450
Stay here Senior Brother.

164
00:09:28,530 --> 00:09:30,450
Ceng Niu wanted to destroy my Dao Heart

165
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,960
but he never thought that

166
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,990
not only was it not destroyed,

167
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,070
but it's even more complete now.

168
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:39,560
I don't know what the intentions of Mount Suzaku are

169
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,280
regarding our upcoming battle.

170
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,640
But this is exactly what I want.

171
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,040
Junior Sister,

172
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,720
Spirit of the Eastern Sea

173
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,600
This is the Spirit of the Eastern Sea that I've found,

174
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,090
it will regrow your arm.

175
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:56,960
Please take it.

176
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,400
I don't need it.

177
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,680
Every time I look at my empty sleeve,

178
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,240
my urge to kill Ceng Niu increases.

179
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,320
Until I kill Ceng Niu,

180
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,360
my arm will stay missing.

181
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,240
Junior Sister !

182
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:14,120
He's using my arm

183
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:15,360
to curse me.

184
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,040
Ceng Niu...

185
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:20,080
I'm definitely going to kill you !

186
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,360
One more poison curse,

187
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,400
just in case she shows up.

188
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:28,680
The country of Suzaku knows where I'm hiding.

189
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,960
but they didn't tell Red Butterfly

190
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,960
and only sent a challenge letter.

191
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,640
This is weird.

192
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:42,280
This battle with Red Butterfly is inevitable

193
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:45,560
so I'd better get ready.

194
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:10,200
I'm taking back the Beast Trap

195
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:12,600
to use for this beast.

196
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:16,090
If you wish to stay, then follow me.

197
00:11:16,410 --> 00:11:18,400
If you don’t, then you may leave.

198
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:36,640
Capture !

199
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,760
Restrain !
